msgctxt "152"
msgid "I knew it! That's my wallet, isn't it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Is it? Not sure why I have it, but I certainly didn't steal it from you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Liar! How else would it have ended up in your pockets?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Thief! Somebody help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "Now hold on a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "What's wrong, Mariko? This guy botherin' you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Oh, Toru, thank goodness you're here. This guy stole my wallet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Oh yeah? He looks like a thug, all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"But let's not start a riot in public. Why don't we go settle this over "
"there, old man?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Now then, hand over Mariko's wallet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Take it. Like I said, I didn't steal it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>Somebody's Wallet<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Looks like everything's still in order. I'm not missing any cards or cash..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"Okay, here's how we're gonna do this. You're obviously a crook, and I'll "
"bet the cops would give you hell if we called them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Pickpocketing's no small offense. Plus, we caught you red handed, and we've "
"got witnesses to back us up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"But seeing as we don't wanna disturb the peace any more than we already "
"have, I'm willing to let you off easy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Mariko got her wallet back, and that's what matters. No need to involve the "
"police and complicate things, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"So here's how this is gonna play out. You pay up, let's say... a hundred "
"thousand, and we pretend this never happened. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "...You want me to pay you 100,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "I'm not giving you that much money for a wallet I didn't steal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "What, your head too far up your ass to hear what I'm saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"If you like the view so much, maybe I should shove your head up there so "
"far, it'd take a crowbar to pry it out. Or you can pay me and keep your "
"head intact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Fine. Here's the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "There you go. Makes life easier for everyone when we all cooperate, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid ""
"I hope you learned your lesson. Keep your hands to yourself if you don't "
"want to get locked up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "Let's get outta here, fellas. We've got bigger fish to fry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Just 100,000 yen, right? Fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Atta boy. No need to complicate things, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "...Damn. Looks like I don't have that much on me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "You kiddin' me, pops? Cough up the cash or I'll feed you your own teeth!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Stop right there! I told you to empty your pockets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "I didn't steal your wallet, lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Show me what you've got, then! If you didn't steal it, then you should have "
"nothing to hide!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Open the <Color:7>Pause menu<Color:Default> and check your items. If "
"there's something that doesn't belong to you, try confirming what it is by "
"using it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Hey! I said empty your pockets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "I didn't steal your wallet, lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
